Description:
 linuxmuster-base7 - linuxmuster.net configuration scripts
Changes:
 linuxmuster-base7 (7.4.14) lmn74; urgency=low
 .
   * fix(e_fstab.py): mask quotaon units unconditionally, only re-run
     remount/quotacheck/quotaon when quota isn't active yet (f163951).
   * fix(import_subnets.py): use lighter /core/firmware/status endpoint,
     exit non-zero on all failure paths instead of silently logging
     success (5a8e9cb).
   * fix(create-keytab.py): use StrictHostkeyChecking=no for firewall ssh
     calls, so a reinstalled firewall doesn't break keytab creation
     (7662592).
   * fix(e_fstab.py): don't force the ext4 quota feature onto non-root
     filesystems - dracut never enables it there; plain usrquota/grpquota
     already works via the external quota-file mechanism (2562346).
   * fix(e_fstab.py): mask quotaon@.service and fix quota activation on
     non-root filesystems - quotacheck only scanned the first of several
     mountpoints and only checked user, not group quota (bc2fd21).
   * fix(e_fstab.py): don't let root's reboot need skip quotacheck/quotaon
     for unrelated non-root filesystems in the same run (0b3476d).
   * fix(e_fstab.py): stop masking quotaon@.service, unmask it instead -
     masking it disabled quota reactivation on every future reboot, not
     just the one problematic first boot (9ba8072).
   * fix(d_templates.py): use "ntpd -q -g" for the one-time sync instead of
     bare "ntpd", which never exits and permanently blocks port 123,
     making the following ntpsec.service start fail (7f731ce).
